# Demo seed

A feature that adds a screen or a flow a host, a guest, a supplier or a staff user can see also updates the backend demo showcase (`casazen/backend`, `DemoShowcaseCatalog`) in the same change, with invented but format-valid data marked as test. The standing requirement is `backend/Sessions/specs/_TEMPLATE.md`, section “Demo seed”.
